---
const faqs = [
  {
    question: "How long does a typical interior design project take?",
    answer:
      "Single room projects typically take 2-3 months, multi-room spaces 3-5 months, and full homes 5-8 months. Timelines depend on vendor availability, material sourcing, and on-site implementation. We'll provide a detailed timeline during your initial consultation.",
  },
  {
    question: "Can I see designs before committing to purchases?",
    answer:
      "Absolutely. You'll receive detailed mood boards with color palettes, furniture options, and 3D renderings of your space. This lets you visualize the final design and make informed decisions before buying anything.",
  },
  {
    question: "What if I don't like the initial design concept?",
    answer:
      "We provide multiple concept options in each design package. If you'd like additional mood board variations, that's available as an add-on service. Your feedback directly shapes the final design direction.",
  },
  {
    question: "Do you handle furniture and material sourcing?",
    answer:
      "Yes. I coordinate with vendors, source materials, and manage procurement. I have established relationships with quality suppliers across Kathmandu to get you the best options within budget.",
  },
  {
    question: "Will you be present during the implementation phase?",
    answer:
      "For full home and multi-room packages, on-site supervision is included. For single room projects, supervision is available as an add-on. I oversee installation, quality checks, and final styling to ensure everything matches the design vision.",
  },
  {
    question: "How do you approach understanding my design preferences?",
    answer:
      "During our initial consultation, we discuss your lifestyle, aesthetic preferences, color choices, and functional needs. I also ask about your daily routines to ensure the design works beautifully and practically for how you actually live.",
  },
];
---

<section>
  <div class="px-8 py-12 max-w-xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-4xl tracking-tight text-base-900 text-balance font-medium">
      The answers to the most <span class="block"
        >popular frequent questions</span
      >
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-base-600">
      Can't find your answer? Send an
      <a
        class="text-blue-500 hover:text-base-900 duration-200"
        href="mailto:hello@ishikadahal.com.np"
      >
        email
      </a>
      and I will get back to you.
    </p>

    <div
      class="mt-8 bg-white rounded-3xl text-base-900 divide-y divide-base-100"
    >
      {
        faqs.map((faq, i) => (
          <details class="px-8 py-6 group">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium  flex justify-between items-center">
              {faq.question}
              <svg
                class="size-4 ml-2 transform transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 10.939l3.71-3.71a.75.75 0 111.06 1.06l-4.24 4.24a.75.75 0 01-1.06 0l-4.24-4.24a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"
                />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-base-600">{faq.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
